              "text": "vorāgō, vorāginis — \"a chasm, an abyss; a whirlpool\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In mediō forō terra sē aperit, et vorāgō magna fit. In the middle of the forum the ground opens, and a great chasm forms."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Third declension, feminine: vorāgō, vorāginis f., from vorō 'to swallow'."
            }
          ]
        },
