              "text": "mānō, mānāre — \"to trickle, to flow, to drip\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Aqua frīgida ē saxō mānat. Cold water trickles out of the rock."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "mānō, mānāre, mānāvī, mānātum. Also of news: to spread. English emanate comes from ēmānāre."
            }
          ]
        },
